# 实验辅助系统整体架构（合并 origin/main 后）

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph User["用户层"]
        Teacher["教师 Web 端\nfrontend-repo / Vue"]
        Student["学生 Web 端\nfrontend-repo / Vue"]
    end

    subgraph Gateway["接入层"]
        Nginx["Nginx 反向代理"]
    end

    subgraph Backend["后端服务\nbackend-repo / Spring Boot"]
        direction TB
        Controllers["API Controllers\n/api/**"]
        Security["Security\nJWT / 角色鉴权"]
        Services["业务 Services"]
        Academic["academic 兼容层\n旧系统 Legacy 适配"]
        Infra["基础设施层"]
    end

    subgraph Workers["异步 Worker"]
        GW["grading_worker\nPython FastAPI + Celery"]
    end

    subgraph Data["数据与存储"]
        MySQL[("MySQL 8\n业务主库")]
        Redis[("Redis\n缓存 / 队列")]
        MinIO[("MinIO\n文件对象存储")]
    end

    subgraph External["外部依赖"]
        AI["AI 模型网关\nDeepSeek / 通义千问"]
        PTA["PTA Spider\n可选"]
        RAGProxy["外部 RAG 服务\n127.0.0.1:8001\n仅保留代理转发"]
    end

    Teacher --> Nginx
    Student --> Nginx
    Nginx --> Controllers

    Controllers --> Security
    Security --> Services
    Services --> Academic
    Services --> Infra

    Services --> Redis
    Services --> MySQL
    Services --> MinIO

    GW -.->|消费队列| Redis
    GW -.->|读写| MySQL
    GW -.->|上传证据/报告| MinIO
    GW -.->|调用| AI

    Services -.->|RAG 代理| RAGProxy
    Services -.->|PTA 同步| PTA
    Services -.->|AI 点评/摘要| AI

    classDef deleted fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#ff6666,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
    class RAGProxy deleted
```
